@startuml SpecReviewReportClasses
Title Spec Review — Class diagram (модель отчёта)
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty methods
class Specification {
  filename: str
  source: pdf | txt | md
  units: list[str]
  sha256: str?
  + numbered_units()
  + verify_quote(start, end, quote)
}
class ReviewReport {
  filename: str
  source: Source
  unreadable_pages: list[int]
  summary: str
  report_markdown: str
}
class Passport {
  document_title: str
  run_at: str
  model: str
  agent_version: str
  run_id: str?
  document_sha256: str?
}
class Requirement {
  id: R-ID
  source_id: str?
  text: str
}
class Evidence {
  start: int
  end: int
  quote: str
}
class Check {
  criterion: str
  status: Status
  comment: str
}
class SetCheck
class Finding {
  kind: FindingKind
  severity: Severity
  issue: str
  recommendation: str
  requirement_ids: list[str]
}
class Statistics {
  requirements: int
  violations: int
  critical: int
  passed: int
  needs_revision: int
}
class Verdict {
  status: ready | needs_revision | not_ready
  reason: str
  priorities: list[str]
}
class DecisionReview {
  provider: nace
  status: str
  model: str
  explanation: str
}
class FindingDecision {
  id: D-ID
  probability: float
  status: str
}
class ReferenceReview {
  status: str
  explanation: str
}
class ReferenceSource {
  id: S-ID
  title: str
  issuer: str
  version: str
  sha256: str
  applicability: str
}
class ReferenceObservation {
  id: RF-ID
  source_id: str
  status: str
  issue: str
  recommendation: str
  requirement_ids: list[str]
}
class ReferenceEvidence {
  start: int
  end: int
  quote: str
}
class ReferenceRetrieval {
  mode: str
  sources: list[ReferenceRetrievalSource]
}
class ReferenceDecisionReview
class CompletedReview <<SQLAlchemy>> {
  id: UUID-string
  owner_id: str
  filename: str
  created_at: datetime
  source_format: str
  verdict: str
  requirements: int
  findings: int
  source_units: JSON
  report: JSON
}
Specification ..> ReviewReport : исходный текст
ReviewReport *-- "1" Passport
ReviewReport *-- "0..*" Requirement
ReviewReport *-- "6" SetCheck
ReviewReport *-- "0..*" Finding
ReviewReport *-- "1" Statistics
ReviewReport *-- "1" Verdict
ReviewReport *-- "0..1" DecisionReview
ReviewReport *-- "0..1" ReferenceReview
Requirement *-- "1" Evidence
Requirement *-- "9" Check
SetCheck --|> Check
SetCheck *-- "0..*" Evidence
Finding *-- "0..*" Evidence
Finding ..> Requirement : requirement_ids
Evidence ..> Specification : exact quote
DecisionReview *-- "0..*" FindingDecision
FindingDecision ..> Finding : D-ID (порядковый)
ReferenceReview *-- "0..*" ReferenceSource
ReferenceReview *-- "0..*" ReferenceObservation
ReferenceReview *-- "0..1" ReferenceRetrieval
ReferenceReview *-- "0..1" ReferenceDecisionReview
ReferenceObservation --> ReferenceSource : source_id
ReferenceObservation ..> Requirement : requirement_ids
ReferenceObservation *-- "1..*" ReferenceEvidence : specification_evidence
ReferenceObservation *-- "1..*" ReferenceEvidence : reference_evidence
CompletedReview ..> ReviewReport : serialized JSON
CompletedReview ..> Specification : extracted source_units
note bottom of CompletedReview
  Владение определяется owner_id.
  Нет cross-database FK к users.
end note
@enduml
